    OneTextHub "1" --> "1" HubShell : CreateUI
    OneTextHub "1" --> "11" HubSection : BuildSections
    HubShell --> HubSection : Select builds and shows
    HubSection <|-- HubOverviewTab
    HubSection <|-- HubSettingsTab
    HubSection <|-- HubFontsTab
    HubSection <|-- HubStylesTab
    HubSection <|-- HubCharsetsTab
